OL,3,ATwenty women had breasts removed
OL,4,Aneedlessly, says NHS trust
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty women underwent mastectomies
OL,7,Funnecessarily while being treated for
OL,8,Fbreast cancer, an NHS trust in
OL,9,Fnorth-east England has told the BBC.
OL,11,FThey were among hundreds of patients
OL,12,Fwho came to harm during treatment at
OL,13,Fthe breast unit of the County Durham
OL,14,Fand Darlington Foundation Trust
OL,15,F(CDDFT).
OL,17,FThe admission comes in the wake of
OL,18,Frevelations about serious failures in
OL,19,Fthe unit, as reported by the BBC last
OL,20,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
