OL,3,AAt least 16 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams into Pakistan
OL,5,Amosque
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 16 people, including five
OL,8,Fpolice officers, have been killed after
OL,9,Fa vehicle loaded with explosives rammed
OL,10,Finto a mosque in north-western
OL,11,FPakistan, according to a senior police
OL,12,Fofficial in Peshawar.
OL,14,FA gun battle is still ongoing between
OL,15,Fattackers and security forces at the
OL,16,Fmosque, near police headquarters, in
OL,17,Fthe Kohat district of Khyber
OL,18,FPakhtunkhwa.
OL,20,FOne of the assailants has reportedly
OL,21,Fbeen killed, an officer says, and a
OL,22,Frescue operation is under way.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
