OL,3,ADozens of suspected illegal miners die
OL,4,Ain Nigerian custody
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We believe they suffocated because
OL,7,Fthere was no ventilation," the father
OL,8,Fof one of those detained told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
